# Two-word rows of t gathered into rows three words apart: an odd stride the
# mover's page cuts can leave a one-beat burst on (silicon flaw F-001). On a
# machine with the flaw the gather packs into a scratch and the copy out runs
# on the vector cores (L2.PASS.001, L2.MOV.020).
target ktpu.v9

fn oddrows.l2(t: f16[64, 32] @dram, idx: u32[16] @dram, y: f16[12, 48] @dram)
    gather y[:, 0:32] <- t index=idx
